s position in JavaScript.</span></p>"},{"url":"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/icons/BB_1%20-%20String%20Theory.webp","title":"String Theory","description":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Add a string to a function’s parameter in JavaScript.</span></p>"},{"url":"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/icons/BB_1%20-%20Palette%20Cleanser.webp","title":"Palette Cleanser","description":"<p>Use a number to set the background color of a scene in JavaScript.</p>"},{"url":"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/icons/BB_1%20-%20Truth%20Hurts.webp","title":"Truth Hurts","description":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use a Boolean value to set a sprite’s property in JavaScript.</span></p>"},{"url":"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/icons/BB_1%20-%20Gaining%20a%20Following.webp","title":"Gaining a Following","description":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Set a sprite to follow another sprite in JavaScript. </span></p>"}],"activeGroupId":"dc72025e-7633-4020-8bd8-e6d47cb5fcbe","activeSubGroupId":"dc72025e-7633-4020-8bd8-e6d47cb5fcbe","activeActivityId":"dc72025e-7633-4020-8bd8-e6d47cb5fcbe","status":false,"courseName":"Blue Belt"},"relationShips":{"data":{"programId":"1b04b70e-39e3-4a19-968c-3e7cccc0dd47","courseId":"c7e72544-49e2-4e3b-b3e6-cf460937ec20"}}}
